<title>USA: No budget agreement yet -- White House negotiators.</title>
<headline>No budget agreement yet -- White House negotiators.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>White House negotiators said Thursday an agreement on a balanced budget plan had not been reached yet with congressional negotiators.</p>
<p>White House Budget Director Franklin Raines and White House Chief of Staff Erskine Bowles, at the Capitol, each said no deal had been reached yet.</p>
<p>&quot;This is a good solid agreement for Democrats if we get it. We haven't gotten one yet,&quot; Raines said.</p>
</text>
